diff --git a/experiments/pg17-deletion-leases/README.md b/experiments/pg17-deletion-leases/README.md
--- /dev/null
+++ b/experiments/pg17-deletion-leases/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+# Local PG17 deletion lease rehearsal
+
+Run from the repository root:
+
+```bash
+node experiments/pg17-deletion-leases/verify.mjs
+node experiments/pg17-deletion-leases/verify.mjs --without-migration
+```
+
